+- [ ] 2.1 Extend period parsing to classify `days` vs `hours` periods (on the hour, under 24 h, may cross midnight); verify with tests for valid, cross-midnight, off-the-hour, 24 h or more, and end-not-after-start cases, and that whole-day behavior is unchanged
+- [ ] 2.2 Make the shared pricing helper return `hourlyPrice × hours` for hourly periods and throw when `hourlyPrice` is missing, bypassing any long-stay discount; verify with tests for quote and booking totals, item without hourly price (no booking created), and day pricing unaffected
+- [ ] 2.3 Verify overlap with tests: overlapping hours rejected, adjacent hours allowed, hourly booking blocks a whole-day one and vice versa
